# 统一换行：仓库内部一律 LF，避免 Windows 下检出/提交时的 CRLF 警告
* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本类保持 CRLF，避免 Windows 上执行异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# ===== Unreal 资产为二进制：禁止换行转换，禁止文本 diff =====
*.uasset binary
*.umap   binary
*.uexp   binary
*.ubulk  binary
*.upk    binary
*.udic   binary

# ===== 其它常见二进制 =====
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tga binary
*.wav binary
*.fbx binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.pdb binary
*.exe binary
